The GRIB driver in crates/terrio/src/drivers/grib.rs and crates/terrio/src/drivers/grib/ ports
the rules of GDAL's frmts/grib/gribdataset.cpp, of its copy of NOAA MDL's degrib (naming, levels,
units, grids) and of NCEP's g2clib (the GRIB2 unpacking and template tables).
Its GRIB2 writer, crates/terrio/src/drivers/grib/write.rs, ports GDAL's
frmts/grib/gribcreatecopy.cpp and g2clib's simple packing.

The degrib and g2clib code GDAL bundles (frmts/grib/degrib), from which the GRIB driver's
